dules detected by screening for lung cancer with low dose spiral computed tomography</article-title><source>Lung Cancer</source><year>2003</year><volume>41</volume><issue>Suppl.2</issue><fpage>S40</fpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="b10-poljradiol-77-2-22"><label>10.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Henschke</surname><given-names>CI</given-names></name><name><surname>Yankelevitz</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name><name><surname>Naidich</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>CT screening for lung cancer: suspiciousness of nodules according to size on baseline scans</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>2004</year><volume>231</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>164</fpage><lpage>68</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14990809</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b11-poljradiol-77-2-22"><label>11.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Truong</surname><given-names>MT</given-names></name><name><surname>Sabloff</surname><given-names>BS</given-names></name><name><surname>Ko</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Multidetector CT of solitary pulmonary nodules</article-title><source>Radiol Clin North Am</source><year>2010</year><volume>48</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>141</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19995633</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b12-poljradiol-77-2-22"><label>12.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gurney</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Determining the likelihood of malignancy in solitary pulmonary nodules with Bayesian analysis. Part I. Theory</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>1993</year><volume>186</volume><fpage>405</fpage><lpage>13</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8421743</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b13-poljradiol-77-2-22"><label>13.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zwirewich</surname><given-names>CV</given-names></name><name><surname>Vedal</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Muller</surname><given-names>NL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Solitary pulmonary nodule: High-resolution CT and radiologic-pathologic correlation</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>1991</year><volume>179</volume><fpage>469</fpage><lpage>76</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2014294</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b14-poljradiol-77-2-22"><label>14.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Leef</surname><given-names>JL</given-names><suffix>III</suffix></name><name><surname>Klein</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The solitary pulmonary nodule</article-title><source>Radiol Clin North Am</source><year>2002</year><volume>40</volume><fpage>123</fpage><lpage>43</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11813815</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b15-poljradiol-77-2-22"><label>15.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Siegelman</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name><name><surname>Khouri</surname><given-names>NF</given-names></name><name><surname>Scott</surname><given-names>WW</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Pulmonary hamartoma: CT findings</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>1986</year><volume>160</volume><fpage>313</fpage><lpage>17</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3726106</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b16-poljradiol-77-2-22"><label>16.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><perso